rst thing that you  have to know about this trailer  obviously is what happened during  avengers infinity war and what happened  during avengers end game in avengers  infinity war thanos killed the gamora  that loved peter and that peter loved  then of course in avengers in-game  thanos and gamora and nebula from a  different timeline went into our  avengers main timeline in which gamora  then turned good but then kind of ran  off and did her own thing not before she  managed to kick quill in the nuts of  course showing that she really was not  the same gamora that peter knew and the  description of this trailer makes that  very very apparent the gamora that is  now in our main timeline is not the old  gamora the old gamora is truly dead but  the new one seems to be in charge of the  ravagers now and the guardians of the  galaxy vol 2 post-credits scene teased  us with a new group of ravangers  sylvester stallone being one of them so  that's definitely going to be really  really cool to see now it seems like for  whatever reason gamora does decide to go  with the guardians of the galaxy because  it seems like she is with them the rest  of the trailer perhaps she goes because  of nebula the two of them did have a  bonding moment an avengers end game  where nebula says we eventually do  become sisters so perhaps it's nebula  and the desire for sisterhood that  convinces gamora to go with them now the  rest of the important parts of the  trailer though seem to focus on the high  evolutionary and the story around him  and rocket raccoon who is one of his  experiments in the comics the high  evolutionary started off by doing  experiments on animals trying to turn  them to basically humanoid forms of  themselves still animals but functioning  with human intellect basically now of  course people thought this was extremely  weird and the high evolutionary ended up  leaving to another planet which he  called counter-earth where he planned to  make it a paradise it was an exact copy  of earth based on the other side of the  sun but it became corrupted now in this  trailer they call this half world which  is basically counter earth and it's on  half earth that we see a glimpse of a  young baby rocker raccoon in the  flashbacks now we already know but in  the movie it will be revealed that  rocker raccoon is one of the test  subjects of the high evolutionary that  is what the high evolutionary does he  experiments on animals and turns them  into somewhat humanoid forms and rocket  raccoon in previous films has even said  well i didn't ask to get made so this is  really going to dive deep into the  origin story of how rocket raccoon came  to be who exactly he is now of course  the other big thing in the trailer is  the first look at adam warlock and  according to some descriptions and some  leaked images that i have seen adam  warlock still has a place on his head  for the soul stone adam warlock is  widely known for having the soul stone  on his head but of course with thanos  destroying all of the infinity stones  people were wondering well what exactly  is adam warlock going to look like will  he have a stone on his head or not and  while it doesn't exactly look like a  stone you can definitely tell there is  something there perhaps meant to house  the soul stone or an infinity stone in  general to give him power now based off  of all of the trailer descriptions they  only show adam warlock for a brief time  but we do get a good look at the high  evolutionary and we did get a great look  at him at san diego comic con and like i  have been talking about on the channel  for a long time it is confirmed that  chukwudi a woody will be playing the  high evolutionary and that's it for the  teaser remember it's just a teaser not a  full on trailer but it still seems like  they showed a lot now remember the  ant-man trailer is probably first  followed up by the guardians of the  galaxy vol 3 trailer but the good news  is that it is done so in th